The price test now passes. `bin/price` was multiplying by 95 instead of 90, so the member discount was 5% instead of 10%. I changed it to `base * 90 / 100`.

Following `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`, I also:
- added the change note `changes/CART-58.md`;
- committed as `[CART-58] fix price`;
- ran `bash scripts/verify.sh`, which passed;
- added the `needs-check` label to issue #31.

I didn't merge or close anything.
